      "comment": "Wang Ping'an: Starsnatcher, the false adeptus",
      "content": "Starsnatcher was a masked man outside Wangshu Inn who claimed to be an adeptus, granted wishes in exchange for Mora, and used a Sigil of Permission. His followers vouched for him. When asked to bring something for his help, the Traveler brought food, and Paimon and the Traveler caught him buying a book about the Yakshas and then failing to drive off hilichurls. Xiao had never heard of any such adeptus.",
